msgid "# Context Compression"
msgstr "压缩"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:9
msgid ""
"> Runtime context compression: conversations are **fully retained in the "
"database**; only the **four-segment view** sent to the LLM is trimmed.  > "
"Related: [`sleep.md`](sleep.md), [`memory.md`](memory.md)."
msgstr ""
"> 运行时上下文压缩：对话在**数据库中完整保留**；仅裁剪发给 LLM 的**四段视图"
"**。 > 相关：[`sleep.md`](sleep.md)、[`memory.md`](memory.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:11 docs/concepts/sleep.md:14
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:22 docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:11
msgid "## Design Principles"
msgstr "## 设计原则"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:18
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Attribute | Value |\n"
#| "| --------- | ----- |\n"
#| "| Trigger | Cron only, daily 03:00 (`0 3 * * *`), no manual trigger |\n"
#| "| Target | All active `semantic_memory` |\n"
#| "| Operations | Contradiction detection + expiry marking, split, dedup merge—three sequential rounds |\n"
#| "| Tools | `memory_semantic_create` / `memory_semantic_update` / `memory_semantic_deprecate` / `memory_semantic_merge` |\n"
msgid ""
"| Principle           | Description                                                                    |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| No message deletion | History is kept; compression only changes runtime view and session meta        |\n"
"| Four segments       | LLM context = system + summary + slim + raw                                    |\n"
"| On-demand trigger   | Compress when usage nears window limits; higher thresholds in tool loops       |\n"
"| Memory-independent  | Compression does not trigger semantic extraction; light sleep cron is separate |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 属性     | 值                                                                                                          |\n"
"| -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 触发     | 仅 cron，每天 03:00（`0 3 * * *`），不支持手动触发                                                          |\n"
"| 处理对象 | `semantic_memory` 全量 active 记忆                                                                          |\n"
"| 操作     | 矛盾检测 + 过期标记、拆分、去重合并，三轮顺序执行                                                           |\n"
"| 工具     | `memory_semantic_create` / `memory_semantic_update` / `memory_semantic_deprecate` / `memory_semantic_merge` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:20
msgid "## Runtime Four Segments"
msgstr "## 运行时四段结构"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"① system  — system prompt (self layer + resident memory + project context)\n"
"② summary — text summary of compressed portion (synthetic; not stored in messages)\n"
"③ slim    — middle segment: trimmed user/assistant messages\n"
"④ raw     — recent segment: full messages including tool calls\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"① system  — 系统提示词（自我层 + 常驻记忆 + 项目上下文）\n"
"② summary — 被压缩部分的文本摘要（合成；不存入 messages）\n"
"③ slim    — 中间段：裁剪后的 user/assistant 消息\n"
"④ raw     — 最近段：完整消息（含 tool 调用）\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:29
msgid ""
"Non-compression path: append new messages to raw only; boundaries unchanged."
msgstr "非压缩路径：新消息仅追加到 raw；边界不变。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:31
msgid ""
"Compression path: when usage exceeds thresholds, older messages move into "
"summary/slim; summary text updated asynchronously."
msgstr ""
"压缩路径：用量超过阈值时，较早消息移入 summary/slim；摘要文本异步更新。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:33
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Configured"
msgid "## Configuration"
msgstr "已配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:35
msgid ""
"Adjust in `config.yaml` (full example: repo root `config.example.yaml`):"
msgstr ""
"在 `config.yaml` 中调整（完整示例见仓库根目录 `config.example.yaml`）："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```yaml\n"
"models:\n"
"  deepseek-v4-flash:\n"
"    context_window: 1000000\n"
msgstr ""
"```yaml\n"
"models:\n"
"  deepseek-v4-flash:\n"
"    context_window: 1000000\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"compression:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  reserved_tokens: 8192\n"
"  trigger_low: 0.60 # outside tool loop: compress at 60% usage\n"
"  trigger_high: 0.80 # inside tool loop: compress at 80% usage\n"
"  emergency_ratio: 0.92\n"
"  raw_min_messages: 5\n"
"  slim_min_messages: 50\n"
"  summary_max_tokens: 4000\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"compression:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  reserved_tokens: 8192\n"
"  trigger_low: 0.60 # 工具循环外：60% 用量时压缩\n"
"  trigger_high: 0.80 # 工具循环内：80% 用量时压缩\n"
"  emergency_ratio: 0.92\n"
"  raw_min_messages: 5\n"
"  slim_min_messages: 50\n"
"  summary_max_tokens: 4000\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Setting             | Default | Description                         |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n"
"| `trigger_low`       | 0.60    | Threshold in normal conversation    |\n"
"| `trigger_high`      | 0.80    | Threshold inside tool loop          |\n"
"| `raw_min_messages`  | 5       | Minimum messages in raw segment     |\n"
"| `slim_min_messages` | 50      | Minimum messages in slim after trim |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 设置                | 默认值  | 说明                                |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n"
"| `trigger_low`       | 0.60    | 普通对话中的阈值                    |\n"
"| `trigger_high`      | 0.80    | 工具循环内的阈值                    |\n"
"| `raw_min_messages`  | 5       | raw 段最少消息数                    |\n"
"| `slim_min_messages` | 50      | 裁剪后 slim 段最少消息数            |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:60
msgid "Without `context_window`, falls back to message-count triggers."
msgstr "未配置 `context_window` 时，回退到按消息数触发。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:62
msgid "Force compression in chat: `/compress` (`--force` ignores hysteresis)."
msgstr "在对话中强制压缩：`/compress`（`--force` 忽略迟滞）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:64
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "## Relationship to Memory Layer"
msgid "## Relationship to Memory Pipeline"
msgstr "## 与记忆层的关系"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:65
msgid ""
"Compression and light/deep sleep run **independently**: compression manages "
"the current session's LLM window; memory extraction runs nightly from the "
"full conversation archive."
msgstr ""
"压缩与浅睡/深睡**独立运行**：压缩管理当前 session 的 LLM 窗口；记忆提取每晚从"
"完整对话存档运行。"
